.TH SOLOCAST 1 "2026" "SoloCast" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
solocast \- one-person live streaming site
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B solocast
.SH DESCRIPTION
Starts SoloCast: a local server with the viewer page and the streamer studio,
opens the studio in the default web browser and, on request, publishes a
shareable public address.
.PP
There are no command-line options. Sharing and quitting are controlled from the
studio page.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/solocast/
Settings and log file.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/kerstz/solocast
